      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZULU SHARP (2) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this trip which boasts four wins. Comes off a (29.75) win last time, scoring by 4 lengths in a Grade 5 over 515m at this track. Rates on top and should go close. STILTON SHINE (6) goes very well at the course with two wins and a placing from four starts. Scored by 1.75 lengths last time (34.45) in a NG over 603m at this track. Looks a key chance on best figures. RAYMAR SHAME (3) is an accomplished stayer with a great record at the longer races. Last start was fourth over 520m at Wentworth Park in a Grade 5 (30.22) but extra ground suits this time. Form at the trip excellent including five wins. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Deserves plenty of respect. FLASH ETHICS (7) is in form and worth thought again.",
